  "description": "Filtering, sorting and paging for IQueryable, driven by whatever the client sent. Declare a filter per row type, register a predicate per supplied value, and get a page plus its total count back. Multi-column and nested-property sorting, a search-across-columns helper, and EF Core-translatable predicate composition.",
  "id": "Muslim.Filter",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-15T11:04:16.54Z",
  "licenseFile": "LICENSE.txt",
  "licenseUrl": "https://aka.ms/deprecateLicenseUrl",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "7V4iYlT4WVCcZOX7msopT6rmVt46BvOahY3w+NLtxztKG6vh0GxIZGIXXV8zM4ZvghSvw1hq2Yh8Nu4KYHbnbw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 50361,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/mazen1998m/Muslim",
  "published": "2026-10-15T10:55:13.583Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes a large PageIndex overflowing into a negative offset (first page returned in memory, SQL error on EF Core), Search throwing on a null navigation in memory and inlining the search term into SQL, sorting failing on properties hidden with new or differing only by case, and appsettings.json defaults being ignored when the file has comments, trailing commas or different key casing. ApplyFilterOnly now sets Query. Ships version-matched agent guidance and generates .agents/skills/muslim-filter during normal consuming builds; preserves user files and supports MuslimFilterGenerateSkill=false. See CHANGELOG.md and README.md.",
